          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Donald Trump said of negotiations with Iran, \"They’re going to go quickly one way or the other. It’s not very complex.\"",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/aug/03/us-iran-trump-strait-of-hormuz-talks-israel-gaza-lebanon-latest-news-updates",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Donald Trump outlined a two-phase plan where phase one is opening the Strait of Hormuz and phase two is denuclearisation.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/aug/03/us-iran-trump-strait-of-hormuz-talks-israel-gaza-lebanon-latest-news-updates",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Trump called off threatened military strikes against Iran for the 12th time during the war after Gulf allies urged diplomacy.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/aug/03/us-iran-trump-strait-of-hormuz-talks-israel-gaza-lebanon-latest-news-updates",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Iranian Foreign Ministry spokesperson Esmaeil Baghaei denied that Iran is currently holding any direct talks with the United States.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/aug/03/us-iran-trump-strait-of-hormuz-talks-israel-gaza-lebanon-latest-news-updates",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Esmaeil Baghaei stated that Iran is negotiating with Oman to establish an acceptable shipping route through the Strait of Hormuz.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/aug/03/us-iran-trump-strait-of-hormuz-talks-israel-gaza-lebanon-latest-news-updates",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Donald Trump wrote on Truth Social calling Iranian leadership \"unbelievably duplicitous\" after Tehran denied holding talks.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/aug/03/us-iran-trump-strait-of-hormuz-talks-israel-gaza-lebanon-latest-news-updates",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US President Donald Trump stated that Iran has a \"last chance\" to reach a nuclear agreement.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/8/3/trump-says-talks-with-iran-are-last-chance-to-forge-a-deal?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "summary"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Global oil prices fell following Trump's announcement, with Brent Crude dropping 4.5% to $83.98 and US-traded oil dropping 4.6% to $80.74.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c23579jzv08o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Approximately 20% of the world's crude oil and liquefied natural gas normally flows through the Strait of Hormuz.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c23579jzv08o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "According to Kpler data, commercial shipping through the Strait of Hormuz dropped by 28% to 51 vessel crossings between July 30 and August 2.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c23579jzv08o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US Vice-President JD Vance previously led face-to-face peace negotiations with Iran in Pakistan following warnings by Trump in April.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c23579jzv08o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The armed conflict between the United States and Iran began on February 28, 2026, following US and Israeli strikes on Iranian targets.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/trump-says-us-iran-talks-going-on-right-now-calls-it-tehran-s-last-chance-to-reach-deal-11785781585074.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
      ]
    },
