          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/03/stronger-eu-borders-physical-barriers-ceuta-von-der-leyen",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Leaders of 22 EU member states signed a letter urging effective deterrence against illegal migration and criticizing large-scale regularisations.",
