          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/03/stronger-eu-borders-physical-barriers-ceuta-von-der-leyen",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Italy temporarily suspended passport-free Schengen travel arrangements with Spain for one month following the Ceuta border surge.",
