          "outlet": "DW World",
          "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/ceuta-eu-calls-borders-a-shared-european-responsibility/a-78220701?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "The Moroccan Association for Human Rights reported nearly 130 people died or went missing during the Ceuta border crossings.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "France 24",
